label Greeting
# [signal arg="refresh_desires"]
if {Transaction_GreetingVar} <= 50:
	ManangAna: [pause=0.6] Jusko, what a long day at the karinderya. Good day, anak.
else:
	ManangAna: Good day. My feet are just... they think they're made of lead tonight.

if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	ManangAna: [pause=1.0] ...
	ManangAna: Anak... I... I didn't bring any change today. I'm sorry. 
	ManangAna: I don't get my pay until Friday. Can I pay you next time for these [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]? I promise I'll put it on my tab.
	- Of course, Manang.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		ManangAna: [pause=0.5] Thank you. Salamat talaga. I won't forget this. 
	- I'm sorry, I can't do credit.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		ManangAna: [pause=0.4] Ah. I understand. Business is business. I'll just see what's left in the garden.
else:
	ManangAna: Can you give me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]? Let's make it quick...
[end_timeline]

label Talk
if {Transaction_TalkVar} <= 50:
	ManangAna: I need [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], anak. The kids are going to start eating the furniture if I don't get home soon.
else:
	ManangAna: Just some [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] for me today. Let's make it quick... the laundry isn't going to wash itself.
- Coming right up, Manang.
	ManangAna: Sige, bilisan mo lang ha.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, Manang Ana, we're fresh out of stock.
	ManangAna: Ay, ganoon ba? Sayang naman. [pause=0.4] Sige, I'll just check if we have any leftovers in the fridge.
	ManangAna: Mag-iingat ka dito, anak.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]


label Partial
ManangAna: Salamat, anak. Pakisama na rin ang [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] ha.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 50:
	ManangAna: [pause=0.4] Salamat, anak. You're a lifesaver.
else:
	ManangAna: Sige, I'll see you tomorrow. Make sure you're eating properly, ha? You look thin.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	ManangAna: Um... [pause=0.4] I don't think this is the [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], anak. 
else:
	ManangAna: Susmaryosep... [pause=0.4] I think my eyes are as tired as my feet. This isn't the right one.
[end_timeline]